# What a download holds. GitHub builds release "Source code" downloads and
# Code > Download ZIP with `git archive`, which leaves out everything
# marked export-ignore here: tests, build scripts, the catalogue's source
# data and notes for developers. Downloads hold just the app, its example
# backup, and the user docs and licences. Developers clone the repository.
# tests/release.spec.js checks what's left.
/.github export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.prettierignore export-ignore
/.prettierrc export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/ForgeLedger[[:space:]]Bugs.txt export-ignore
/ROADMAP.md export-ignore
/package.json export-ignore
/package-lock.json export-ignore
/playwright.config.js export-ignore
/scripts export-ignore
/tests export-ignore
/data/sources/*.json export-ignore
